TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:ISGT Asia 2027: Paper submission deadline (23:59 UTC+12 (assumed))
DESCRIPTION:IEEE PES Innovative Smart Grid Technologies Conference Asia (IS
 GT Asia 2027)\n\nPaper submission deadline: 31 Mar 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (as
 sumed)\n\nConference: September 15-17\, 2027\nLocation: Bangkok\, Thailand
 \nVenue: Eastin Grand Hotel Phayathai\n\nAll dates:\n  Paper submission de
 adline: 31 Mar 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Notification of acceptance
 : 30 Jun 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Camera ready submission deadline
 : 31 Jul 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Early-bird registration deadline
 : 31 Jul 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe call for papers states no ti
 mezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it could plausibly mean\,
  so the countdown runs out before the real deadline rather than after it.\
 n\nThemed "AI-Driven Smart Grid Innovation for a Resilient\, Sustainable\,
  and Carbon-Neutral Future"\, hosted by IEEE PES Thailand. Paper submissio
 n opens 1 December 2026\; full papers are limited to six A4 pages in IEEE 
 conference format. The call gives notification as a window (1 May to 30 Ju
 ne 2027)\; its closing date is listed here.\n\nCall for papers: https://ww
 w.isgt-asia-2027.org/\nDetails: https://powersystemdeadlines.org/conferenc
 e/isgt-asia27
LOCATION:Bangkok\, Thailand
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.isgt-asia-2027.org/
CATEGORIES:Smart Grid,Distribution,Renewables,Power Systems
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SEQUENCE:0
